REVIEW WANTED: opus

Sonnet-authored (LOT-119 settings screen). Operator decisions to check against:
- text size is a SLIDER (70–130 %), stored as an in-app offset on top of Dynamic Type; a density toggle;
- the legacy Réglages structure is kept;
- `tabbar_minimize_on_scroll` is KEPT, stored only, applied by LOT-170 (#303);
- the start screen names a tab, default Favoris;
- no CHANGELOG row may claim that the tab bar is dropped.
App code: review it statically (you cannot build the app) and say so.

